<div class="mandarin-hanzi">几</div>
<div class="mandarin-pinyin">jǐ</div>

''Meaning:'' how many; several  
''Part of speech:'' interrogative determiner; numeral

!! In context
你有几个朋友？ — Nǐ yǒu jǐ ge péngyou? — How many friends do you have?

!! Usage note
几 (jǐ) asks about a relatively small quantity and also means 'a few' in declaratives. The traditional form for this sense is 幾, not 几 (jī, 'small table'). Contrast 多少 (duōshao), which has no small-number presupposition.
